GraphAugmented-Intelligence_GAI

This repository is a copy of KG-RAG (Knowledge Graph-based Retrieval Augmented
Generation) by Karthik Soman and colleagues at the Baranzini Lab, University of
California San Francisco.

  Source:  https://github.com/BaranziniLab/KG_RAG
  License: Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
  Paper:   Soman et al., "Biomedical knowledge graph-enhanced prompt generation
           for large language models", arXiv:2311.17330

The framework code (kg_rag/), the data and published result files (data/), the
notebooks (notebooks/, .test_notebooks/), config.yaml, system_prompts.yaml and
requirements.txt are the original authors' work and are unchanged from the
upstream repository as of its commit 01b9f6e (2024-11-09).

Changes made in this copy by Vishal Krishna Kumar:

  README.md       Added the note, "My additions", "Results at a glance",
                  "How KG-RAG answers a question" and "Before you run the
                  framework" sections above the upstream README text.
  .gitignore      Added Python and tool cache entries.
  analysis/       New: summarize_results.py, which scores the published
                  response files.
  tests/          New: tests for the scoring rules and repository file checks.
  .github/        New: continuous integration workflow.
  pytest.ini      New.
  ruff.toml       New.
  NOTICE          New: this file.
